{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17104","headline":"奉陪武相公西亭夜宴陆郎中 · 王良士","name":"奉陪武相公西亭夜宴陆郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳气袭猗兰，青云展旧欢。\n仙来红烛下，花发彩毫端。\n海岳期方远，松筠岁正寒。\n仍闻言赠处，一字重琅玕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王良士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}